## Critical Notes
<critical>
- ALWAYS enforce size limits and timeouts
- NEVER process private inputs without proper signing
- Use parallel processing safely with proper resource management
- Handle all download errors appropriately
- Clean up resources in error cases
- Validate input types before processing
- Maintain proper input ordering
- Track and log input resolution metrics
</critical> 